    "title": "Scottsdale shooting leaves 2 dead - NewsBreak",
    "text": "The Scottsdale Police Department is asking for the public's help in a shooting investigation that left two people dead Monday night near 115 th Street and East Sahuaro. The shooting occurred about 9:50 p.m. June 30. Police were dispatched to the area after receiving 911 calls reporting the sound of gunshots. “Upon arrival, police located a vehicle that had crashed in a ditch. Inside the vehicle, two people were found with gunshot wounds,” police stated in a release. One person died at the scene. The other person died at a hospital. Police said they believe it is an isolated incident. Anyone with information is asked to call 480-312-TIPS.",
